msgid "The initial Slowlog has been ingested.  Post Processing will take place in the background.  You can start analyzing the Details once the status is complete"
msgstr "Slowlog-ga bilowga ah waa la geliyay. Hawl-qabadka dambe wuxuu ka socon doonaa gadaal. Waxaad bilaabi kartaa falanqaynta Faahfaahinta marka xaaladdu dhammaato"

