#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Ogaanshaha Jadwallada Cacti"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Sida looga sooco jadwallada rasmiga ah ee Cacti jadwallada kale ee ku xusan diiwaanka weydiimaha gaabiska ah. Habka asalka ah waa ogaanshaha jadwal kasta iyadoon la kooxeyn."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Ogow dhammaan jadwallada (ma jirto kooxeynta 'JADWALLO KALE')"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Isticmaal Kaydka Xogta Cacti-gan; u kooxee jadwallada kale sida 'JADWALLO KALE'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Ogow dhammaan jadwallada; u kooxee jadwallada aan ku jirin liiska hoose sida 'JADWALLO KALE'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Jadwallada la Daneeyo"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "Waxaa kaliya oo adeegsada ikhtiyaarka 'Ogow dhammaan jadwallada; ku kooxee ... sida JADWALLO KALE' ee kor ku xusan. Fadlan bixi liis jadwallo la yaqaan oo meel banaan u dhexeyso si loola barbardhigo. Nidaamyada Linux/UNIX, waxaad ku heli kartaa liiska jadwallada adigoo adeegsanaya amarka soo socda:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>isticmaale</b></i> -p<i><b>erayga_sirta</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>kaydka_xogta</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>Qiimayaasha '<i><b>isticmaale</b></i>', '<i><b>erayga_sirta</b></i>', iyo '<i><b>kaydka_xogta</b></i>' waxaa lagu beddelayaa qiimayaashaada."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Xadka Soo Gelinta"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Xadka cabbirka faylasha la soo geliyo ee Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Cabbirka Ugu Badan ee Faylka la Soo Geliyo"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Cabbirka ugu badan ee faylka adeegahaaga Apache uu ogol yahay in la soo geliyo waxaa lagu dejiyay qiimaha midigta yaalla. Hadda ma soo gelin kartid fayl ka weyn intaas. Haddii aad leedahay diiwaanno MySQL Slow ah oo ka weyn intaas, waa inaad wax ka beddeshaa faylka <i>php.ini</i> ee la xiriira Apache, raadiso doorsoomaha <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> oo aad kordhiso qiimihiisa. Intaas ka dib waa inaad dib u bilowdaa Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Cabbirka Ugu Badan ee Post"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Cabbirka ugu badan ee aad u diri karto adeegaha Apache waxaa lagu dejiyay qiimaha midigta yaalla. Haddii aad leedahay diiwaanno MySQL Slow ah oo ka weyn qiimahan, waa inaad wax ka beddeshaa faylka <i>php.ini</i> ee la xiriira Apache, raadiso doorsoomaha <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> oo aad kordhiso qiimihiisa. Intaas ka dib waa inaad dib u bilowdaa Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Waqtiga Ugu Badan ee Fulinta"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Inta uu socon karo (ilbiriqsiyo) codsigan; 0 waxay la macno tahay aan xad lahayn. Plugin-kani wuxuu horey ugu kordhiyay aan xad lahayn codsiyadiisa, laakiin adeegaha webka ama wakiilka ka horreeya PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) weli si madax-bannaan ayuu u jari karaa codsiga - taas halkan lagama ogaan karo lagamana dhaafi karo."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Aan Xad Lahayn"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Xadka Xusuusta"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Inta xusuus ah ee codsigan loo ogol yahay inuu isticmaalo; -1 waxay la macno tahay aan xad lahayn. Plugin-kani wuxuu horey ugu kordhiyay aan xad lahayn codsiyadiisa. Diiwaan weydiimo gaabis ah oo aad u weyn oo lagu akhrinayo/soo dhoofinayo hal codsi wuu dhaafi karaa qiime xaddidan."

